# Published evidence packet: store bytes EXACTLY as produced.
# Without this, the repo's text normalization rewrites CRLF to LF in the committed blob, so an external
# acceptor that downloads a file and compares its sha256 against PACKET_MANIFEST.json gets a MISMATCH on
# every CRLF-bearing file. `-text` disables that normalization for this subtree only.
* -text
